+
+### Visual-only snare detections
+
+The separate rolling TONOR audio graph now also runs the existing
+`st7/models/snare_v1` detector continuously. Its onset markers are purple, dotted,
+and labeled **snare**, alongside red ride and blue hi-hat markers. Labels have
+separate rows when sounds overlap; markers use original audio onset timestamps.
+The snare listener has only a graph socket, not a robot-control socket. Its
+hits or failures never enter strike selection, angle/timing calibration, snare
+scheduling, readiness gates, or Stop/center logic. Closing the graph leaves all
+three listeners running; launcher exit cleans them up. `--test` remains audio-free.
